  "description": "ECUCEM crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C56 H66 N4 O22 Yb4. From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb1A (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb2A (Yb) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.576-3.710 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 99.04-108.80°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Yb4(L)2(μ3-OH)2(OAc)6]. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 6 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
